going from fatigue case to no fatigue on Chalder fatigue scale (0-3, higher score = more fatigue;

improvement on VAS of at least 2 points \[VAS going from none \[0\] to 5 \[very severe\] with at least a 3 \[substantial\] on one of the following Sx --\> fatigue, brain fog, widespread pain, Baseline to post-treatment at 6-weeks

