4. Hospitalized, requiring supplemental oxygen;
5. Hospitalized, not requiring supplemental oxygen - requiring ongoing medical care (COVID-19 related or otherwise)
6. Hospitalized, not requiring supplemental oxygen - no longer requires ongoing medical care
7. Not hospitalized, 7 days from enrolment|Duration of hospitalisation (days), Days from the date of enrolment to the date of discharge, 30 days from enrolment|Death, Number of deaths, 30 days from enrolment

